## CRITICAL DEPENDENCIES

This workflow assumes:
- RDA NocoDB table has Published Timestamp field populated (by Apps Script approval webhook)
- Published Timestamp is set when Christine approves records in the Google Sheet
- If Published Timestamp = null, record has not been approved/published yet

If no records have Published Timestamp set yet (because Christine hasn't approved anything), the email will show:
- Approved: 0
- Edited: 0
- SLA: 0/0 on-time
- All other metrics: 0

This is CORRECT behavior for the first few days before approvals exist.

